| OK | 4 480 |
| KO | 0 |
| Duration | 193 s (3 m 13 s — 180 s planned + 13 s drain) |
| Mean throughput | 23.2 req/s |
| Global p50 (median of per-sec medians) | 201 ms |
| Global p95 (median of per-sec p95s) | 620 ms |
